Scope of this licence
----------------------

This MIT licence covers only what this repository adds on top of the
bundled tools: `assets/`, `index.html`, `tests/`, each `tools/*/i18n.*.js`
dictionary, the JIZURA translation tables and build script
(`vendor/jizura/app/chinese.*`, `vendor/jizura/build_toolkit.py`), the
Anime2.5DRig guide `tools/anime-rig/guide.zh-TW.md`, the coc-typesetter
sample scenario (`SAMPLE_META` and `SAMPLE_TEXT` in
`tools/coc-typesetter/app.js`), and the emotion-maker asset-path
restructure.

Each bundled tool under `tools/` keeps its own upstream licence — see
`ATTRIBUTION.md` for the per-tool source and licence status.

`tools/emotion-maker/` is NOT covered by this licence. It is unlicensed
upstream, and all rights — including its 39 image assets — remain with
the original author.

